{"id":"788e53f1-9469-4103-bc66-8a1529b6612b","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243753,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"WITH person_gmv AS (\n    SELECT c.customer_unique_id,\n           SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value) AS gmv\n    FROM orders o\n    JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n    JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id\n    WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n      AND c.customer_unique_id IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY c.customer_unique_id\n),\nranked AS (\n    SELECT customer_unique_id,\n           gmv,\n           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY ROUND(gmv, 2) DESC, customer_unique_id ASC) AS rn,\n           COUNT(*) OVER () AS total_people\n    FROM person_gmv\n)\nSELECT ROUND(\n           SUM(CASE WHEN rn <= CEIL(total_people * 0.2) THEN gmv ELSE 0 END)\n           / NULLIF(SUM(gmv), 0),\n           4\n       ) AS ratio\nFROM ranked;","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答用户中文问题，翻译成一条可执行SQL。需要理解要求。数据库schema只列出了部分表：order_items, customers, members, products, sellers, orders, member_levels, refund_items。还JOIN PLAN 提到 support_tickets, ticket_categories 等但未在schema表列？ 用户问题： \"在有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人中，按累计GMV两位展示值倒序、自然人ID升序取前CEIL(人数*0.2)人（不扩并列），仅输出其占总GMV的小数比率，保留四位。\"\n\n需要解析：统计自然人（customers.customer_unique_id）中，有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人。有效订单=order_status NOT IN ('canceled','unavailable')。GMV含运费=SUM(oi.price+oi.freight_value)。按每个自然人累计GMV（可能不同 customer_id 同 unique_id，需要按 customer_unique_id 分组）。需要按累计GMV两位展示值倒序、自然人ID升序排序，取前 CEIL(人数*0.2) 人（不扩并列）。输出这些人的总GMV占总GMV的小数比率，保留四位。仅输出比率。总GMV是什么范围？ 应该是在\"有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人\"中的总GMV？ 语法可能：先计算每个 natural person 的累计GMV（两位展示值用于排序，但金额计算用原始？问题说\"按累计GMV两位展示值倒序\"排序，使用 ROUND(SUM(price+freight),2) 排序。然后取前 ceil(count*0.2) 人，不扩并列，即 LIMIT count? 但SQL中 LIMIT 需要动态 ceil(人数*0.2)。可用窗口函数计算总人数和排名，然后筛选 rank <= CEIL(total_people*0.2)。\"不扩并列\"意味着不是RANK<=N（会扩并列），而是严格行数限制，即使并列也按自然人ID升序取到第N行。需要用 ROW_NUMBER() 按 gmv展示值 DESC, customer_unique_id ASC 排序，然后 rn <= CEIL(total_count*0.2)。输出这些人的总GMV / 总GMV。总GMV：可能所有自然人的总GMV（有有效订单）。需要确认分母：是总GMV（所有有效订单含运费GMV），还是这些自然人的总GMV？问题：\"仅输出其占总GMV的小数比率\" 其中\"其\"指前20%人，占总GMV。总GMV应是全体有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人的GMV总和。需要排除？ \"在有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人中\" 可能分母基于这些自然人的GMV总和（即全部有效GMV），与全部自然人的有效GMV一致。需要保留四位小数。输出一个数值，列名？ 未明确列名，可 alias ratio。需要只输出一列。必须 LIMIT? 单行聚合 excepted. 输出单行比率，无GROUP BY，聚合不需LIMIT。但查询有窗口等。最终 SELECT 单行。\n\n需要仔细处理自然人与订单/明细连接放大：orders 与 customers 按 customer_id。同一 natural person 可以对应多个 customer_id，orders 关联 customer_id。如果直接 join customers 和 orders 和 order_items，每个 natural person 的 GMV 是 sum oi.price+freight for all their orders valid. 每个订单明细唯一在主键。没问题。但注意 members? 问题提到\"自然人\"定义 customer_unique_id，不需要会员表。 \"有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人\" 即 customer_unique_id NOT NULL? 已知自然人ID。需要排除NULL unique_id，因为未知身份不合并。有效订单排除 canceled/unavailable。GMV use order_items.price + freight_value。需要只统计有有效订单的自然人。如果订单没有明细？ join order_items 会有。但有效订单含GMV，若无明细则sum null? 自然人不计。需要已知有效订单含运费GMV，可能订单有明细。使用 INNER JOIN order_items. 如果有有效订单但没有items，则 no GMV, not included. Fine.\n\n需要计算每个自然人的累计GMV展示值 ROUND(SUM(...),2) 用于排序。 排序：按累计GMV两位展示值倒序、自然人ID升序。 展示值可能是 ROUND(SUM,2)，但排序用展示值。 如果两个自然人原始GMV不同但四舍五入后相同，则并列展示值，按ID升序。 取前 ceil(总人数*0.2)。 不扩并列：用ROW_NUMBER 按 (gmv_rounded DESC, customer_unique_id ASC) 排序，然后 rn <= CEIL(COUNT(*) * 0.2)。 需要总人数是自然人数（有有效订单含GMV）。 然后选中人的GMV总和。分母总GMV：所有这些人（全体自然人）的GMV总和，注意如果按每个自然人汇总后相加，与直接SUM所有有效订单明细相同，不会重复。 比率 = SUM(CASE WHEN rn<=N THEN gmv ELSE 0 END) / SUM(gmv) with NULLIF? 分母 >0 likely. 保留四位。 输出小数比率，使用ROUND(...,4)。 \"小数比率\" 明确原比值，不乘100。保留四位。 必须确保 ROUND 的数字类型。SUM numeric. CEIL(COUNT(*) * 0.2) returns numeric? COUNT bigint * 0.2 numeric -> numeric, CEIL numeric? PostgreSQL ceil(numeric) returns numeric. Compare rn bigint <= numeric okay. Need use window.\n\nSQL结构：\n\nWITH person_gmv AS (\n  SELECT c.customer_unique_id AS customer_unique_id,\n         SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value) AS gmv\n  FROM orders o\n  JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n  JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled','unavailable')\n    AND c.customer_unique_id IS NOT NULL\n  GROUP BY c.customer_unique_id\n),\nranked AS (\n  SELECT customer_unique_id, gmv,\n         ROUND(gmv, 2) AS gmv_display,\n         ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY ROUND(gmv,2) DESC, customer_unique_id ASC) AS rn,\n         COUNT(*) OVER () AS total_people\n  FROM person_gmv\n)\nSELECT ROUND(\n  SUM(CASE WHEN rn <= CEIL(total_people * 0.2) THEN gmv ELSE 0 END) / NULLIF(SUM(gmv),0),\n  4) AS ratio\nFROM ranked;\n\nWait ROUND(gmv,2) in ORDER BY window: gmv is numeric? price numeric + freight numeric => numeric; SUM numeric. ROUND(numeric,2) fine. total_people *0.2 numeric. Good.\n\nBut \"在有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人中\" Could mean among natural persons with known valid orders and freight GMV. \"已知\" maybe customer_unique_id known. yes.\n\nNeed consider if same natural person has multiple customer records and orders. Grouping by unique_id. But joining orders to customers by customer_id, order belongs to specific customer record. For same unique_id multiple customer_id, all orders aggregated. Good. However, there may be duplicate order_items? Primary key ensures unique per order+item. Join customers one-to-one by customer_id. No duplicate. Fine.\n\nNeed \"仅输出其占总GMV的小数比率\" output only ratio. No other columns. Single row. No LIMIT needed due aggregate. Rule 3: must LIMIT, single row no GROUP BY COUNT/SUM/AVG etc excepted. This is aggregate without GROUP BY? Final SELECT has SUM, no GROUP BY, single row. Excepted.\n\nNeed maybe \"按累计GMV两位展示值倒序、自然人ID升序取前CEIL(人数*0.2)人（不扩并列）\" Could require ranking by rounded GMV, but \"累计GMV两位展示值\" maybe the value should be rounded to two decimals for ranking only, not for numerator/denominator? If ranking ties determined by rounded value, but actual selection ratio should use actual GMV? Need decide. They explicitly mention \"累计GMV两位展示值\" for sorting, likely order by ROUND(SUM(...),2). But when calculating \"其占总GMV\", should use actual cumulative GMV or display rounded? \"累计GMV两位展示值\" modifies sorting, not necessarily sum. Metrics default money ROUND two. But ratio should use actual GMV? Hmm. The question: \"按累计GMV两位展示值倒序...取前...人...仅输出其占总GMV的小数比率，保留四位。\" They specify two-decimal display value for ranking. Could mean use rounded GMV as cumulative metric for selection, and then ratio with those selected persons' total GMV (maybe actual? or sum of rounded?). Usually ranking by displayed GMV. Ratio computed from underlying GMV. Need avoid mismatch. We can use gmv actual for sum of selected and total. Ranking by rounded. Good.\n\nCould there be need to count \"人数\" as natural persons with known valid order GMV. yes count distinct customer_unique_id in person_gmv. COUNT(*) after group. Good.\n\nNeed \"不扩并列\" means use ROW_NUMBER not RANK. Good.\n\nNeed \"仅输出...比率\" no labels? alias okay? They said only output ratio; alias not extra column. Could use no alias? \"SELECT ROUND(...)\" only one column. Better no alias? SQL can have expression unnamed. But output column name maybe \"round\". The instruction says only output needed dimensions/metrics; alias okay. \"仅输出其占总GMV的小数比率\" one column. Alias can be ratio. Fine.\n\nNeed maybe use CEIL(total_people * 0.2) but if total_people=0 then no rows? If no valid orders, person_gmv empty, ranked empty, SUM returns NULL? Actually final aggregate over empty returns one row with SUM NULL? SELECT ROUND(NULL/NULL,4) -> NULL. But rule says empty count 0, other aggregate NULL. Here no data, ratio NULL. Fine. But if total_people =0, no division. Empty ranked, SUM(CASE...) NULL, SUM(gmv) NULL, NULLIF(NULL,0)=NULL, NULL/NULL -> NULL. Good.\n\nNeed possible issue: CEIL(total_people * 0.2) returns numeric with .? For total 5 -> ceil(1.0)=1. Good. For total 1 -> ceil(0.2)=1. For total 0 impossible. Good.\n\nNeed not include status? We include valid_order filter. The problem explicitly \"有效订单\". yes.\n\nNeed \"已知有效订单含运费GMV\" maybe \"已知\" also refers to customer_unique_id not null. yes.\n\nNeed use orders.order_status NOT IN ('canceled','unavailable') as metric valid_order. But \"含运费GMV\" metric gmv_with_freight has same filter. Good.\n\nNeed join order_items to orders. Use c.customer_unique_id grouping. Need possibly customers table alias c. Good.\n\nPotential pitfall: customer_unique_id is varchar; NULL ordering in ROW_NUMBER? We exclude null. Good.\n\nPotential issue: \"自然人ID升序\" in ties. For customer_unique_id strings, ascending. Good.\n\nPotential issue: \"总GMV\" could mean total GMV of all orders (including natural persons without known ID?) The phrase \"在有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人中\" defines population. \"其占总GMV\" likely total GMV of that population. If total GMV across all valid orders including unknown natural persons, then denominator would include unknown customer_unique_id. But \"在有已知...的自然人中\" means population restricted to known persons. Since they ask among natural persons, denominator likely all known persons. Need decide. \"有已知有效订单含运费GMV的自然人中\" = among natural persons with known valid order GMV. \"仅输出其占总GMV\" Could \"总GMV\" refer to sum over all such natural persons. I'd use denominator from person_gmv (known natural persons). If unknown customer_unique_id excluded. Good.\n\nNeed consider \"累计GMV\" per natural person. We group by customer_unique_id. Great.\n\nNeed maybe calculate total people via COUNT(DISTINCT customer_unique_id) independent of order_items? If natural person has valid order but no items, no GMV and excluded. The phrase \"有已知有效订单含运费GMV\" means GMV >? Actually includes only persons with valid order and freight GMV. If order items sum zero maybe still GMV 0; \"含运费GMV\" could be zero? They have valid orders with GMV maybe zero? In e-commerce, price/freight maybe nonzero. We don't filter gmv >0. If a natural person has valid order with items sum 0, they are in person_gmv with gmv=0. Does \"有已知有效订单含运费GMV\" imply includes GMV including zero? They have known GMV. We don't add >0. Good.\n\nNeed maybe output ratio to 4 decimal. Use ROUND(...,4). PostgreSQL ROUND numeric. Good.\n\nNeed final just SQL. No code fences. Since instructions say direct SQL. We can include one line comment? Rule 18 allows comment if complex. But final should only SQL. We can skip comment. Need ensure one SELECT. WITH is okay one SELECT? It includes CTEs and final SELECT. \"只输出一条SELECT\" WITH ... SELECT is one statement. Good.\n\nLet's craft:\n\nWITH person_gmv AS (\n    SELECT c.customer_unique_id,\n           SUM(oi.price + oi.freight_value) AS gmv\n    FROM orders o\n    JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n    JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id\n    WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n      AND c.customer_unique_id IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY c.customer_unique_id\n),\nranked AS (\n    SELECT customer_unique_id,\n           gmv,\n           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY ROUND(gmv, 2) DESC, customer_unique_id ASC) AS rn,\n           COUNT(*) OVER () AS total_people\n    FROM person_gmv\n)\nSELECT ROUND(\n           SUM(CASE WHEN rn <= CEIL(total_people * 0.2) THEN gmv ELSE 0 END)\n           / NULLIF(SUM(gmv), 0),\n           4\n       ) AS ratio\nFROM ranked;\n\nNeed check SUM(CASE WHEN ... THEN gmv ELSE 0 END) is numeric. Good. CEIL(total_people * 0.2) numeric. rn bigint <= numeric okay? PostgreSQL can compare bigint and numeric, yes.\n\nPotential issue: using ROUND(gmv,2) in window ORDER BY but gmv could be numeric, okay.\n\nWould final output be ratio of selected top 20% of natural persons by rounded GMV to total GMV. Yes.\n\nLet's ensure \"不扩并列\" with ROW_NUMBER; if top N cutoff ties by rounded GMV, order by unique_id asc chooses exact N. Good.\n\nCould use CEIL(COUNT(*) OVER () * 0.2) but total_people includes all. Good.\n\nNeed no LIMIT? Final aggregate single row no GROUP BY, exception. Good.\n\nNeed maybe alias \"ratio\" is extra? It's column name. Fine.\n\nNeed final only SQL."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":3894,"completion_tokens":3585,"total_tokens":7479,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3367},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":2102},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}